ransson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Stenberg</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fredriksson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonzalez-Rey</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Bertilsson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nilsson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>Nature Methods</source><year>2006</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>725</fpage><lpage>727</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nmeth916</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Jarvius J, Melin J, G&#x000f6;ransson J, Stenberg J, Fredriksson S, Gonzalez-Rey C, Bertilsson S, Nilsson M (2006) Nature Methods 3:725&#x02013;727 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16929318</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Diehl</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Dressman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Vogelstein</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinzler</surname><given-names>KW</given-names></name></person-group><source>Nature Methods</source><year>2006</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>95</fpage><lpage>97</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nmeth850</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Li M, Diehl F, Dressman D, Vogelstein B, Kinzler KW (2006) Nature Methods 3:95&#x02013;97 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16432518</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tsongalis</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name></person-group><source>Am J Clin Pathol</source><year>2006</year><volume>126</volume><fpage>448</fpage><lpage>453</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1309/90BU6KDXANFLN4RJ</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Tsongalis GJ (2006) Am J Clin Pathol 126:448&#x02013;453 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16880139</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sikes</surname><given-names>HD</given-names></name><name><surname>Hansen</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Jenison</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Birks</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Rowlen</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowman</surname><given-names>CN</given-names></name></person-group><source>Nature Materials</source><year>2007</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>52</fpage><lpage>56</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nmat2042</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Sikes HD, Hansen RR, Johnson LM, Jenison R, Birks JW, Rowlen KL, Bowman CN (2007) Nature Materials 7:52&#x02013;56 </citation></ref><ref id="CR13"><label>13.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hansen</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Sikes</surname><given-names>HD</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowman</surname><given-names>CN</given-names></name></person-group><source>Biomacromolecules</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>355</fpage><lpage>362</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/bm700672z</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Hansen RR, Sikes HD, Bowman CN (2008) Biomacromolecules 9:355&#x02013;362 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18052028</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wilcheck</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bayer</surname><g